{"id":"657933","name":"焦香土豆","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/657933/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"红辣椒圈","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"个大土豆洗净去皮。","img":"images/657933/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用淀粉混匀（无需加水）。","img":"images/657933/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆我分两部分炸制。","img":"images/657933/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"另一部分土豆下锅炸制金黄。","img":"images/657933/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出炸好的土豆。","img":"images/657933/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再分别复炸一遍。","img":"images/657933/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"控油捞出至另一个不粘锅中。","img":"images/657933/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中加入少许料酒、盐、红椒圈、葱花翻炒。","img":"images/657933/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒出锅，囗感焦香。","img":"images/657933/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}